# Space (live server): the positioned effects. Elanor (Terran Enforcer, _login_space) uses the skill of hotbar slot 5
# (Enrage Group) on a mob of /createmob, then warps to a nav
# point as sp_flight does (W, the target panel's >> twice, Q): effect 443's chain (effect.ini) puts the emissions
# warp01p1-3, the tunnels warp_tun01a-c (BaseAsset 1767-1769) and WarpEffect 23 (wrp01) about the ship. All are
# source-based effects that eff_o.cpp's 0x6E7AA0 places with the ship's 0x725AD0. The warp camera
# (CameraController02Class, 0x7979A0) holds a fixed place while the ship flies off. Retail first (2026-11-21): its
# shots are the expected result.
# Run: e2e.py --live [--retail] --db-snapshot 7 --instance warp run sp_warp (it moves Elanor and spawns a mob; the
# snapshot puts her back).
name: space effects: a skill's area effect and sound, then the warp's slipstream
timeout: 360
include _login_space
# first the skill of hotbar slot 5 (its tooltip on Elanor's rows of 2026-11-21: Enrage Group, energy 600, "enrages all
# members of a target group") on a mob of /createmob 1993 (E): without a target the server answers "No target
# chosen!" (a PRIORITY_MESSAGE, run 125448); slot 4 (Biocessation, organic targets) drew one on the mob (125158).
# The effect it starts (OBJECT_EFFECT / OBJECT_TO_OBJECT_EFFECT) is read from the events: no wait for it here
key 0x0D
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
text '/createmob 1993'
key 0x0D
expect-event antprox 'received CLIENT_CHAT$' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent CREATE$' within 15
wait-event antprox 'sent RELATIONSHIP$' within 15
key 0x45 until antprox 'received REQUEST_TARGET$' every 1.5 within 20
wait-event antprox 'sent SET_TARGET$' within 10
click 865,960
expect-event antprox 'received SKILL_ABILITY$' within 10
alive 1
shot skill_1s
alive 2
shot skill_3s
# the nearest nav point, the next one twice (Nav Group Shrine, about 55k), then the warp
key 0x57 until antprox 'sent SET_TARGET$' every 1.5 within 15
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
click 1248,987 until antprox 'sent SET_TARGET$' every 1.5 within 15
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
click 1248,987 until antprox 'sent SET_TARGET$' every 1.5 within 15
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot nav_target
pose-mark
key 0x51
expect-event antprox 'received WARP$' within 10
alive 3
shot warping_3s
alive 5
shot warping_8s
wait-event antprox 'sent WARP_INDEX$' within 90
expect-pose moved 20000
shot warped
expect-no CRASH
